id: pm-todos-zpyc
title: Certify pm-todos on CLI 2026.9.27 and pinned GitHub extension
description: "Main pins PM CLI, pm-ops, and pm-changelog 2026.9.23 and manages pm-github 2026.8.18. Host CLI 2026.9.27 reports extension SDK-link skew. CI and the disabled scheduled sync install unversioned pm-github through an obsolete npm 10 shim and rewrite its manifest. Align published tool pins and managed extension source in both workflows, and retain the disabled sync boundary until a separate pre-push privacy gate passes."
type: Issue
status: blocked
priority: 1
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:github","area:release"
created_at: "2026-09-27T08:15:15.176Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T22:49:13.270Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Package and lock pins updated to published CLI, pm-ops and pm-changelog; managed pm-github source exact 2026.9.26; canonical launcher and real broken-install child tests pass; strict health and full release gate pass; sync stays disabled pending privacy gate; exact-head CI and review complete."
repro_steps: "On main, run pm health --strict-exit --json under host CLI 2026.9.27 and observe extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew; inspect CI and sync workflow unversioned extension installs. After updating pm-ops, the existing canonical launcher byte-identity test fails until its published template is copied."
expected_result: Project-local CLI/SDK 2026.9.27 and managed pm-github 2026.9.26 pass strict health; both workflows install exact source; full release and packed acceptance pass; sync stays disabled.
actual_result: Main has old SDK linkage and workflow installs can drift to future unreviewed versions.
